- CVSS 3.1: cvss_score (number), cvss_vector (e.g. "AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"), cvss_metrics (the eight metrics as English values, e.g. {"AV":"Network","AC":"Low","PR":"None","UI":"None","S":"Unchanged","C":"High","I":"High","A":"High"}).

